Description:
Dom Distiller is a java library that extracts article content from a web page.
It is compiled to javascript with GWT.

This repo is maintained by Chromium engineers by bundling contents from
https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/dom-distiller/.

This dependency will be deprecated, see https://crbug.com/493762526.

